     "y": 352,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "Every table in the hall wobbles but one. Someone has folded ration slips under the legs of this one, and someone else keeps taking them."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I sit down at the wobbling table with whoever's there, and ask how they're doing."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 5,
     "name": "Halm",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 1,
     "x": 2096,
     "y": 352,
     "width": 48,
     "height": 96,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "person",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "halm"
      },
      {
       "name": "asks",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "What does the council want, Speaker?\nHow are the civilians taking all this?"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "H"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 6,
     "name": "Calm tabs",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 1264,
     "y": 480,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "item",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "calm_tabs"
      },
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "A dispenser of calm tabs with a handwritten tally taped to it. The tally is longer than you'd like."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I ask the doctor for a strip of calm tabs."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "q"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 7,
     "name": "Seven",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 1,
     "x": 1744,
     "y": 480,
     "width": 48,
     "height": 96,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "person",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "seven"
      },
      {
       "name": "asks",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "How are the synthetics being treated aboard?\nWhat do you need from me?"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "S"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 8,
     "name": "The far table",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 2064,
     "y": 480,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "The one table in the hall that doesn't wobble, which is why the council meets here. The carved initials go back three captains."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I sit down at the far table and make it clear that I've got time to listen."
      },
      {
       "name": "useOther",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I sit down near the far table, and listen to what's being said there."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "f"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 9,
     "name": "Ration crate",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 1424,
     "y": 608,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "item",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "ration_pack"
      },
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "Sealed ration packs, counted twice a day. The quartermaster knows exactly how many are in there, and you're not sure anyone else does."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I ask for a ration pack from the crate, the same as anyone else."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "x"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 10,
     "name": "Brandt",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 1,
     "x": 1456,
     "y": 672,
     "width": 48,
     "height": 96,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "person",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "odessa"
      },
      {
       "name": "asks",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "How long will the rations really last?\nWhat are we running short of that nobody's said?"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "O"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 11,
     "name": "The scan bed",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 976,
     "y": 736,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "The medbay's one working scanner. Its log has a lot of entries at three in the morning."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I ask the doctor to run me through the scan bed."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "b"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 12,
     "name": "The records terminal",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 1104,
     "y": 736,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "A records terminal bolted beside the scan bed, its keys worn shiny. Everyone aboard is on it somewhere: who they are, where they sleep, and how they are."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I sit down at the records terminal."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "r"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 13,
     "name": "A cot with its curtain drawn",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 304,
     "y": 800,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "A shape under a thin blanket, and a hand that doesn't move when you stop beside it. The chart at the foot of the cot has been filled in very neatly."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I read the chart on the curtained cot and ask how they're doing."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "c"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 14,
     "name": "Start",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 4,
     "x": 2576,
     "y": 992,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 64,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true
    },
    {
     "id": 15,
     "name": "Aduro",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 1,
     "x": 720,
     "y": 1120,
     "width": 48,
     "height": 96,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "person",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "aduro"
      },
      {
       "name": "asks",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "How bad is it in here, Doctor?\nWhat's the medbay short of?"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "A"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 16,
     "name": "Emergency hull patches",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 1296,
     "y": 1120,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "item",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "emergency_patch"
      },
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "A rack of emergency hull patches, stored in the medbay because it's the one locker with a working seal."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I ask the doctor if I can take one of the emergency hull patches."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "a"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 17,
     "name": "Up to deck 1",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 3,
     "x": 3632,
     "y": 1248,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 64,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "to",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "deck1"
      },
      {
       "name": "via",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "3"
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "3"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 18,
     "name": "A warm bunk",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 2864,
     "y": 1312,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "Someone got out of this rack a minute ago, and someone else is already waiting beside it with their boots in their hand. It's never had time to go cold."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I ask whoever's waiting by the warm bunk how long they've been on their feet."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "t"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 19,
     "name": "A sack under a rack",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 2864,
     "y": 1632,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "A canvas sack, shoved under a lower bunk. It's far heavier than it looks, and when you nudge it with your boot, it clinks like a great many washers."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I ask whose sack this is, and what's in it."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "h"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 20,
     "name": "The queue",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 720,
     "y": 1696,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "A bench for six, with eleven people on it. Nobody's complaining, which worries you more than if they were."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I sit down on the bench with the queue and ask what brought them here."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "w"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 21,
     "name": "A photograph in a rack frame",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 2,
     "x": 2832,
     "y": 1824,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 56,
     "rotation": 0,
     "visible": true,
     "properties": [
      {
       "name": "look",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "A family on Aurelis, all of them squinting into the sun, tucked into the rack frame where someone can see it lying down. There's a date on the back, and it's the last week of the Concord."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I ask the nearest sleeper whose photograph this is."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "p"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": 22,
     "name": "Down to deck 3",
     "type": "",
     "gid": 3,
     "x": 3504,
     "y": 1888,
     "width": 40,
     "height": 64,
     "rotation": 0,
